BudgetCompatibilityCostEnabled=Cost calculation enabled in DynamicPrices
BudgetCompatibilityValuationCore=Project, Product, ProductFournisseur and native confirmation contracts are present on Dolibarr 20–24. Additional module tables are required.
BudgetCompatibilityShipmentCore=Native shipments and validation on Dolibarr 20–24. Supplier price events use SUPPLIER_PRODUCT_BUYPRICE_* in 20–22 and PRODUCT_BUYPRICE_* from 23 onward.
BudgetCompatibilityOptionalCore=Optional integration on Dolibarr 20+. The installed external module contract is checked before each call; this capability is not provided by the core.
BudgetCompatibilitySpreadsheetCore=PhpSpreadsheet is bundled with Dolibarr 20–24; the PHP ZipArchive extension is required.
BudgetCompatibilityPdfCore=Native project document models and PDF library are present on Dolibarr 20–24.
BudgetCompatibilityDynamicDescription=Read-only access to active, successfully calculated costs. Date, currency, entity and permissions are checked per product, without recalculation.
BudgetCompatibilityDynamicUnavailable=Enable the dynamicsprices module and its costs, with a version providing the compatible DynamicPricesCostService contract.
BudgetCompatibilityPriceListDescription=Read applicable prices and recorded historical amounts using the order, target and quantity tier.
BudgetCompatibilityPriceListUnavailable=Enable PriceList with compatible get_price, getEffectiveCostPriceForRow and getHistory methods. No local replacement is provided.

